<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n839" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγρέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱρέω</span>
			, <i>take, seize</i>, freq. in Aeolic Inscrr. as <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(2).6.33
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			, Lesbos); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγρει δ᾽ οἶνον ἐρυθρόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archil.
					4.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρόμος παῖσαν ἄγρει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					2.14
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				294
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγρεῖ πόλιν</span>
			<i>captures</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				126
			</span></i> (lyr.); of fishing, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.304
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Phanias</span>); in prescriptions, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγρει</span>, <i>take!</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				534
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only in imper. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγρει</span>, prop
				<i>take it!</i>, hence, <i>comeon!</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγρει μάν οἱ ἔπορσον Ἀθηναίην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.765
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.487
			</span></i>; pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγρεῖτε </span>(
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγρειτε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>An. Ox.</u>
					1.71
				</span></i>
			) <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				20.149
			</span></i>. Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄργειτε</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
